			"Message": "chore(Output): Update TODO comments to FUTURE in ESBuild configs\n\nThis commit updates TODO comments to FUTURE across three ESBuild configuration files:\n- CodeEditorLand/Editor/Bundle.ts\n- Exclude/Electron.ts\n- Microsoft/VSCode/Bundle.ts\n\nThe changes reflect a reprioritization of pending tasks, converting them from 'TODO' to 'FUTURE' scope. In CodeEditorLand/Editor/Bundle.ts and Microsoft/VSCode/Bundle.ts, the TODO for adding logging to track external module usage has been updated. In Exclude/Electron.ts, the TODO for compiling from Electron-wise binaries has been similarly updated.\n\nThis is a purely cosmetic/documentation change with no functional impact on the build process or output artifacts.",
